  "details": "Very similar to this error: https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1350-string-error-generaluserisprivateworld\n\nThis bug is easy to reproduce, here's how it happened...\n\n1. Open the QM, and click on Change Shield Level.\n\n2. Expand the menu into the main menu, so that it takes you to the Safety Tab.\n\n3. Alter your custom shield level, and instead of clicking \"Use This Shield Level\", press Escape, or close out of the menu with the QM button.\n\n3. The message displays instead as \"+General/Updated_Custom_Shield_Level\" instead of the intended string.\n\nVideo embed: https://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/449386885299830794/1163272503578345583\n\nVideo file: https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/449386885299830794/1163272503091802182/2023-10-15_19-26-33.mp4?ex=653ef8f1&is=652c83f1&hm=5f3dcdcf11bfe69526a90260cad45238a2cfa3fdc110c558a8b2dbd8905108ee&",
